		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 400;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;

		svg#chevron:where(.svelte-c3hsoj) {
			transition: 0.1s transform;
		}

